<title>USA: Allegheny Teledyne Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Allegheny Teledyne Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			   $0.30		    $0.28</p>
<p> Net			  51,400		   49,000</p>
<p> Revs			920,300		  972,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  174,298		  176,869</p>
<p>			     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			   $1.20		    $1.54</p>
<p> Net			 213,000		  272,300</p>
<p> Revs		    3,815,600		4,048,100</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  174,082		  176,386</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net includes charges for early extinguishment of debt of $0.08/shr vs $0.02/shr for Q4 and the same amounts for 1996 vs 1995 full years.</p>
<p>Net also includes pretax merger and restructuring costs of $18.9 million vs or about $30,000 for Q4 and $57.5 million vs $6.4 million for year.</p>
<p>Shr excluding unusual items is $0.40 vs $0.30 for Q4 and $1.34 vs $1.41 for year.</p>
</text>
